E AX3142 1506-field-effect-curried.ax:16:14-20 field-effect-exceeded "the lambda performs Alloc, and the field `Same.eq` declares `effect(pure)`" #"performs Alloc" !"a call through `Same.eq` is charged what the field declares and nothing else, so everything stored in it has to keep that" !"a lambda of two or more parameters allocates the closure for each argument but the last, so calling it performs `Alloc`; a field of two or more parameters declares `effect(alloc)` at least" ?"store a function that keeps the declaration, or declare the effect on the field with `;@axiom:effect(alloc)`"
